    "zh": "名字和特征",
    "en": "Name and features",
    "ms": "Nama dan ciri"
   },
   "level": "basic",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "p",
     "text": {
      "zh": "{{t:hymenoptera}}来自希腊文 hymen（薄膜）加 pteron（翅），意思是「膜翅」，由林奈命名。",
      "en": "{{t:hymenoptera}} comes from the Greek hymen (membrane) and pteron (wing): 'membrane-winged'. Linnaeus coined it.",
      "ms": "{{t:hymenoptera}} berasal daripada bahasa Yunani hymen (membran) dan pteron (sayap): 'bersayap membran'. Linnaeus mencipta nama ini."
     },
     "defines": [
      "hymenoptera"
     ],
     "src": [
      "ETYM"
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "note",
     "kind": "key",
     "text": {
      "zh": "「膜」就是薄膜：四片透明的翅，加一条细腰。",
      "en": "Think 'membrane': four clear wings and a wasp waist.",
      "ms": "Ingat 'membran': empat sayap jernih dan pinggang tebuan."
     },
     "src": [
      "ETYM"
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "list",
     "items": [
      {
       "zh": "两对透明的膜质翅",
       "en": "Two pairs of clear membranous wings",
       "ms": "Dua pasang sayap bermembran yang jernih"
      },
      {
       "zh": "胸和腹之间有明显的细腰",
       "en": "A clear narrow waist between thorax and abdomen",
       "ms": "Pinggang sempit yang jelas antara toraks dan abdomen"
      },
      {
       "zh": "蚂蚁的腰上有一两个结，触角膝状",
       "en": "Ants have one or two nodes on the waist and elbowed antennae",
       "ms": "Semut mempunyai satu atau dua nod pada pinggang dan sesungut bersiku"
      },
      {
       "zh": "蜂类腹末有螫针",
       "en": "Bees and wasps have a sting at the tip of the abdomen",
       "ms": "Lebah dan tebuan mempunyai sengat di hujung abdomen"
      }
     ],
     "src": [
      "TJ:39",
      "TJ:38",
